        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for the Linux Kernel RT (Live Patch 1 for SUSE Linux Enterprise 16)",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "\nThis update for the SUSE Linux Enterprise kernel 6.12.0-160000.6.1 fixes various security issues\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2025-39963: io_uring: fix incorrect io_kiocb reference in io_link_skb (bsc#1251982).\n- CVE-2025-40204: sctp: Fix MAC comparison to be constant-time (bsc#1253437).\n- CVE-2025-40212: nfsd: fix refcount leak in nfsd_set_fh_dentry() (bsc#1254196).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
