        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nio_uring: fix incorrect io_kiocb reference in io_link_skb\n\nIn io_link_skb function, there is a bug where prev_notif is incorrectly\nassigned using 'nd' instead of 'prev_nd'. This causes the context\nvalidation check to compare the current notification with itself instead\nof comparing it with the previous notification.\n\nFix by using the correct prev_nd parameter when obtaining prev_notif.",
          "title": "CVE description"
        }
      ],
      "product_status": {
        "recommended": [
          "openSUSE Leap 16.0:kernel-livepatch-6_12_0-160000_6-rt-3-160000.1.1.x86_64"
